I'll hand it over and turn myself in.

00:59:44.414 --> 00:59:47.416
I think you're forgetting that your wife's life is in my hands.

00:59:47.417 --> 00:59:49.293
You know whose fault that is?

00:59:49.294 --> 00:59:51.922
Today, you and your husband You're both dead.

